Observed:
    int: seen 10
    int: inline_seen 1
end: Observed
D:
    int: seen 10
    int: pad 99
    int: x 10
    Code:
        :=: (data \ seen) x
        int: x 2
        int: x 3
    end: Code
    Inline:
        int: pad 90
        int: x 1
        int: seen 1
        if: 1 ((int x 7))
        :=: (Inline \ seen) x
    end: Inline
end: D
Main: D\Code() D\Inline() (:= (Observed \ seen) (D \ seen)) (:= (Observed \ inline_seen) ((D \ Inline) \ seen))
